Add a live native launcher peer over the native and shell sessions

desktop_native_peer drives sophia_ns over sophia_ss and 9P, through public
APIs only, against a production file export: opening, allocation, upload,
permit, candidate, Prepared and Presented, exact focus, reserved input
edit and ack, keyboard activation, close, allocation invalidation and
resource release. A control socket only schedules scripted Session steps;
the session stays serviced while a barrier waits. The fixture's frozen
clock means no deadline or production timing is covered.
